    "body": "> That’s the wrong question. What you want to know is whether moving will be possible in more cases in the future and whether some kind of dependency on not moving there established by APIs such as the one proposed here will make that infeasible.\n\nSure, that's fair. Which cases do you expect to become movable? Libraries will fall back to `insertBefore()` regardless, so that dependency exists either way. Having some sense of the cases would help us evaluate whether a built-in fallback actually makes them harder.",
